# A fast pattern (32nd notes on four tracks) while P1 and P2 jump and sweep across their whole range every few steps.
tempo 150
steps 64
tail 1.5
track kick
param p1 0 0
param p2 0 0
sweep p1 0 255 0 16
sweep p2 220 0 0 16
sweep p1 255 0 16 32
sweep p2 0 255 16 32
param p1 0 33
param p2 255 33
param p1 255 40
param p2 0 40
param p1 128 48
param p2 200 48
param p1 30 56
param p2 60 60
note 0 F3 0.5 127
note 4 Gb3 0.5 127
note 8 F3 0.5 127
note 12 Ab3 0.5 127
note 16 F3 0.5 127
note 20 G3 0.5 127
note 24 F3 0.5 127
note 28 Ab3 0.5 127
note 32 F3 0.5 127
note 36 Gb3 0.5 127
note 40 F3 0.5 127
note 44 G3 0.5 127
note 48 F3 0.5 127
note 52 Eb5 0.5 127
note 56 F3 0.5 127
note 60 E5 0.5 127
track snare
sweep p1 255 0 0 20
sweep p2 0 255 0 20
sweep p1 0 255 20 40
sweep p2 255 0 20 40
param p1 200 44
param p2 230 44
note 4 A3 0.5 110
note 12 Bb3 0.5 110
note 20 B3 0.5 110
note 28 A3 0.5 110
note 36 A3 0.5 110
note 44 Bb3 0.5 110
note 52 B3 0.5 110
note 60 C4 0.5 110
track perc
sweep p1 0 255 0 64
sweep p2 0 255 0 8
sweep p2 255 0 8 16
sweep p2 0 255 16 24
sweep p2 255 0 24 32
param p2 128 32
note 0 Db4 0.5 90
note 2 D4 0.5 70
note 4 Db4 0.5 90
note 6 Eb4 0.5 80
note 8 Db4 0.5 90
note 10 D4 0.5 70
note 12 Db4 0.5 90
note 14 E4 0.5 80
note 16 Db4 0.5 90
note 18 D4 0.5 70
note 20 Db4 0.5 90
note 22 Eb4 0.5 80
note 24 Db4 0.5 90
note 26 D4 0.5 70
note 28 Db4 0.5 90
note 30 E4 0.5 80
note 32 Db4 0.5 90
note 34 D4 0.5 70
note 36 Db4 0.5 90
note 38 Eb4 0.5 80
note 40 Db4 0.5 90
note 42 D4 0.5 70
note 44 Db4 0.5 90
note 46 E4 0.5 80
note 48 Db4 0.5 90
note 50 D4 0.5 70
note 52 Db4 0.5 90
note 54 Eb4 0.5 80
note 56 Db4 0.5 90
note 58 D4 0.5 70
note 60 Db4 0.5 90
note 62 E4 0.5 80
track sample
sweep p1 255 0 0 64
sweep p2 255 0 0 64
note 1 A4 0.5 100
note 9 Bb4 0.5 100
note 17 B4 0.5 100
note 25 C5 0.5 100
note 33 D5 0.5 100
note 41 E5 0.5 100
note 49 Db5 0.5 100
note 57 B4 0.5 100
expect sound 0 64
expect idle 80
expect peak_below 0
